---
import SlideLayout from '../../../layouts/SlideLayout.astro';
---
<SlideLayout
  title="Slide 14 - Podsumowanie"
  bgImage="/images/background-1.jpg"
  bgOverlay="linear-gradient(rgba(10,14,23,0.78), rgba(10,14,23,0.9))"
>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="header">
      <span class="level-chip"><i class="ti ti-checkbox"></i> Podsumowanie</span>
      <h1 class="title">
        4 poziomy <span class="highlight">i</span> 1 zasada
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="layout">
      <div class="pyramid">
        <div class="step step-1">
          <div class="step-index">L1</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h3>Context</h3>
            <p>Czym jest system i jak pasuje do otoczenia?</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step step-2">
          <div class="step-index">L2</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h3>Containers</h3>
            <p>Z jakich głównych części się składa?</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step step-3">
          <div class="step-index">L3</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h3>Components</h3>
            <p>Co jest wewnątrz kontenera?</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step step-4 optional">
          <div class="step-index">L4</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h3>Code <span class="hint">· opcjonalny</span></h3>
            <p>Jak wygląda implementacja?</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="closing">
        <i class="ti ti-quote"></i>
        <p>
          W C4 chodzi o pokazywanie systemu na <strong>właściwym poziomie szczegółowości</strong>,
          <strong>właściwym osobom</strong>, we <strong>właściwym kontekście</strong>.
        </p>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>
</SlideLayout>

<style is:global>
  .stage {
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 1640px;
    padding: 56px 3rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.15s forwards;
  }

  .level-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 7px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.35);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .level-chip i { font-size: 18px; }

  .title {
    font-size: 72px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .title .highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan-400), var(--cyan-600));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap: 48px;
    width: 100%;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .pyramid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 88px 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 22px;
    padding: 22px 28px;
    background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.25);
    border-radius: 18px;
    text-align: left;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease-out forwards;
    position: relative;
  }

  .step::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 4px;
    border-radius: 18px 0 0 18px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--cyan-400), var(--cyan-600));
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .step-1 { animation-delay: 0.4s; margin-left: 0; }
  .step-2 { animation-delay: 0.55s; margin-left: 32px; }
  .step-3 { animation-delay: 0.7s; margin-left: 64px; }
  .step-4 { animation-delay: 0.85s; margin-left: 96px; }

  .step.optional {
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
    background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.55);
  }

  .step.optional::before {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fbbf24, #d97706);
  }

  .step-index {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.35);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .step.optional .step-index {
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12);
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
    color: #fcd34d;
  }

  .step-body h3 {
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f1f5f9;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  }

  .step-body h3 .hint {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fcd34d;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-left: 8px;
  }

  .step-body p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .step-body p em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #fcd34d;
  }

  .closing {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 32px 36px;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.10), rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.55) 60%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.4);
    border-radius: 22px;
    text-align: left;
    position: relative;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease-out 1.05s forwards;
  }

  .closing i {
    position: absolute;
    top: 18px;
    left: 22px;
    font-size: 42px;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    opacity: 0.35;
  }

  .closing p {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 48px;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .closing strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
  }

  .closing .strike {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.55);
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }
</style>
